"bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["在这个钟点，很容易就能找到营地里的野战厨房——烤无酵饼的香气会引导饥饿的人穿越营帐构成的迷宫。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["红弩箭","","Lilya","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613300761","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["倒是正好赶上了饭点。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她在一只硕大的汤锅前瞄到了与其他士兵站在一起的谢尔盖，他正端着碗，一边往口中塞食物一边不停说话。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_10.jpg","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,75,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529923.png","audio":"613301055","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["……说时迟那时快，朋友，我仿佛是看到子弹朝我飞过来。真的，一定是我身上的护身符起作用了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529922.png","audio":"613301056","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我赶忙一个侧身，虽然是躲过了致命伤，但子弹还是往我腿肚子里打去了。你们绝对想不到那是什么滋味……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["红弩箭","","Lilya","","","","",""],"head_icon":"300401.png","audio":"613300762","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我看你恢复得挺快啊，谢尔盖。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529921.png","audio":"613301057","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["中尉，你来了——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"78":{"step":[[78,79,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["谢尔盖手中的碗一抖，不自觉地并腿立正，些许菜汤洒在他的手指缝里。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_3/3_3_bg_10.jpg","choice":[]},"79":{"step":[[79,80,""]],"type":1,"name":["红弩箭","","Lilya","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613300763","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["刚把腿肚子里的子弹取出来，你就能自己走来捞汤喝了？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"80":{"step":[[80,81,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529901.png","audio":"613301058","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那……那是当然，我可是钢筋铁骨。唉，说到这汤啊——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"81":{"step":[[81,82,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["他举起手中的碗，容器内是泡着一张饼的卷心菜汤。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"82":{"step":[[82,83,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529922.png","audio":"613301059","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["你看看我们吃的是什么东西啊？当兵的不能就靠这些东西过活呀。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"83":{"step":[[83,84,""]],"type":1,"name":["红弩箭","","Lilya","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613300764","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["别抱怨了，你自己不是藏了一些肉干吗？——拿出来吃了吧。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"84":{"step":[[84,85,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["红弩箭也从供餐处拿走一块饼，又从汤锅中舀起一碗汤。纤薄的菜叶像是一片浸湿的纱布一般沉在碗底。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"85":{"step":[[85,86,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["和所有人的吃法一样，红弩箭也用菜汤来泡软干硬的无酵饼。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"86":{"step":[[86,87,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["谢尔盖掏出一些肉干交给红弩箭，自己又从身后拿出一瓶藏好的饮料。瓶中的液体清亮透明，看似无害。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"87":{"step":[[87,88,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529924.png","audio":"613301060","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["给，你也喝点。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"88":{"step":[[88,89,""]],"type":1,"name":["红弩箭","","Lilya","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613300765","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这还不错。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"89":{"step":[[89,90,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529901.png","audio":"613301061","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……所以，到底是怎么回事，土匪手里怎么会有那样厉害的玩意儿，能把你都打下来？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"90":{"step":[[90,91,""]],"type":1,"name":["红弩箭","","Lilya","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613300766","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["现在谁也说不准匪军是怎么搞到这些玩意儿的，也不知道他们想拿这些武器干什么。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"91":{"step":[[91,92,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529901.png","audio":"613301062","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这还不好猜吗？！他们当然是要去打劫村子……这可糟了，村子里留守的那点人可遭不住这种火力。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"92":{"step":[[92,93,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["青年哥萨克脸上的阴云来了又去，他的心很快被另一个念头占据。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"93":{"step":[[93,94,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613301063","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我听说咱们队下午没有安排，你要不要和我一起去河边网点鱼？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"94":{"step":[[94,95,""]],"type":1,"name":["红弩箭","","Lilya","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613300767","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["在这种时候捞鱼？你不怕会被人一枪打死吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"95":{"step":[[95,96,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529901.png","audio":"613301064","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我知道安全的地方，再说，我随身带着护身符，子弹打不死我的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"96":{"step":[[96,97,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529901.png","audio":"613301065","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["就算是在打仗，没有东西吃也不行。虽然麦子不长了，但河里一定还有不少鱼。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"97":{"step":[[97,98,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["红弩箭以审视的目光查看谢尔盖据说中弹了的小腿。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"98":{"step":[[98,99,""]],"type":1,"name":["红弩箭","","Lilya","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613300768","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我记得你腿肚子不是被打坏了吗，这就能去捞鱼了？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"99":{"step":[[99,100,""]],"type":1,"name":["谢尔盖","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529901.png","audio":"613301066","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这、这没什么妨碍的！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"100":{"step":[[100,101,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["谢尔盖几口扒拉完最后的食物，放下碗跑远了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"101":{"step":[[101,151,""]],"type":1,"name":["红弩箭","","Lilya","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613300769","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["呵，我看顶多就是被擦破了一点皮。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"102":{"step":[[102,152,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","